{title: Jaiye Aap Kahan Jayenge}
{artist: Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am],        Jaiye aap kahan jayenge,
[F] [G] [Am],        ye nazar laut ke phir aayegi
[F] [G] [Am],        ye nazar laut ke phir aayegi
[Am] [F] [G],        Door tak aap ke pichhe pichhe
[Am] [F] [G],        Door tak aap ke pichhe pichhe
[D] [Am],        Meri aawaz chali jayegi
[G] [Am],        Aapako pyaar mera yaad jaha aayega
[G] [Am],        Koi kaanta wohi daaman se lipat jayega
[F] [G] [Am],        Koi kanta wohi daman se lipat jayega
[Am],        Jaiye aap kahan jayenge......
[G] [Am],        Jab uthoge meri betab nigahon ki tarah
[G] [Am],        Rok lengi koi dali meri baahon ki tarah
[F] [G] [Am],        Rok lengi koi dali meri baahon ki tarah
[Am],        Jaiye aap kahan jayenge......
[G] [Am],        Dekhiye chain milega na kahi dil ke siva
[G] [Am],        Aapaka koi nahi koi nahi dil ke siva
[F] [G] [Am],        Aapaka koi nahi koi nahi dil ke siva
[Am],        Jaiye aap kahan jayenge......
